        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/gta-week-last-drive-header-2.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>In the decade or so since <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/gta-online\">Grand Theft Auto Online</a>'s arrival, its roads have become a kind of home; well-loved by its racers, its gear heads, and speed freaks. It's a game that allows players to lose themselves in the roleplay, the heists, and the crime sprees. But for me, an occasional dipper into its major updates, the car folk have always been the engine driving its appeal.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-grand-theft-auto-online-last-ride\">Read more</a></p>",
